title: Introduce `sp-coretime` primitives crate

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Introduces sp-coretime, a primitives crate for Polkadot Coretime types and traits.
      Moves shared coretime types and the Market trait from pallet-broker into sp-coretime.

      This allows market implementations (e.g. an RFC-17 pallet) to depend on sp-coretime
      instead of pallet-broker, avoiding a pallet dependency just for trait definitions and
      shared types.

      pallet-broker re-exports everything from sp-coretime for backward
      compatibility. No breaking changes. The major bump on pallet-broker is because
      type paths in the public API changed (e.g. RegionId now originates from
      sp-coretime), which the semver tool picks up as a major change.

crates:
  - name: sp-coretime
    bump: minor
  - name: pallet-broker
    bump: major
